You can try to wait for some monster to dig your way free -- sooner or
later dwarves and rockmoles are bound to appear. The problem is, of course,
not to starve in the meantime.
Maybe you can kill a leperchaun that passes by and eat it, thus getting
intrinsic teleport ("You feel jumpy"), which is annoying, but gets you out
of such a problem.
 
